:8410,"target_id":"c35bf23167a9e622a92998078b11169108b367b4c07f24b40cbb4f263948da55","source_hash":"c2fbcde7f1d258e0c33a99f26f67b3facb905350c6f3a4a92cd04d5157770cef","text":"条款 3 和 4 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00057","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8410,"end":8449,"target_id":"4901ef6e1bc04497659774fba78e3a2fee1ada61ddbb4b9f1bf9529a1679f340","source_hash":"b83dcd79f4e418c3900030251a9fa2ca9940147894d0959567807390a4a6fc7a","text":"附录（关于部分修改经济策划委员会组织等的条例）<1989年6月17日第12733号条例>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00058","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8449,"end":8480,"target_id":"829485246857d0784408a13c427cfba08ca149bedaeebd5c22d022e10329093e","source_hash":"de0ec285fd3ffce32091f02ba3a05908eaef136736b1d9962924dadd14284017","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00059","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8480,"end":8644,"target_id":"1920ba89a6565d892f77f21b37fc5338f12fd2571fa29ca0500cf799cd72d00e","source_hash":"9d57c161d7dbc6884618dd82bf1d69d17d2354809e2f1f0ad120663169b03fdf","text":"第二条（关于人员配额的过渡措施）  本法令生效时，如现有人员属于因本法令实施而需裁减的职级公务员，则该职级公务员的人员配额应视为单独存在，直至该等人员被专门招聘为技术级公务员为止，且与该等人员对应的技术级公务员人员配额不予填补。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00060","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8644,"end":8779,"target_id":"4454ab3d7c7a2784002e94cd1efa1b45c42c706c8cba01fd337d32abfe206e65","source_hash":"9036fd2e57ddf8b0c636a6da1a6c7db12a7e5d69693e68cbebe86a68d16545e9","text":"第三条（关于从事杂务的技术公务员的过渡措施）尽管本法令另有规定，但根据总统令第12704号（即修改公务员任命法的法令）附录第五条第二款被视为已任命为其他职级技术公务员的人员，可以继续担任其原职级。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00061","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8779,"end":8793,"target_id":"6a111a81e2a744875ce272de980fe9e0fe44f2c247b17b4d7bc0385805324a82","source_hash":"505b854c331342cb48efd5424cf798126129d808876646cd1a9e4b5b22346bf6","text":"条款 4 和 5 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00062","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8793,"end":8865,"target_id":"df76945173c09067569b71ed