定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00112","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":11530,"end":11575,"target_id":"02d09f3385322638ef4912be4bf57e910d0b92df8e410ba1ace6eb059986e6b0","source_hash":"452d2d95328a8a5764a60dcbb6e3ab906244ea60a29b722862ec357cf8e3783b","text":"补充规定 <第28432号，2017年11月14日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00113","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":11575,"end":11599,"target_id":"f8edb95a19d54542ae6e043e89cf754e82cece2f8028ca2a354a2b14a195ebb4","source_hash":"8eb41aca99499579b23072379ca3a73193c1650fbceaada4a1138de978428e23","text":"补充规定 <第29655号，2019年3月26日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00114","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":11599,"end":11628,"target_id":"48607c160c39cad1daaa6ddf7f8d99c44d2bd81698de020175ff062669f3a85a","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00115","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":11628,"end":11704,"target_id":"371f01800cff98532f34a28009eb923a2cfaa46ec6cba5187c7524ecad4c8232","source_hash":"02dc3f5e075549ca4bd229a24f8d5dd0c8a4513588cd646f7010fa4dfe443170","text":"第二条（适用于转学入学）第十七条之二的修改规定适用于从转入学士学位课程到2023学年转学入学筛选的情况。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00116","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":11704,"end":11800,"target_id":"f4fc8719fc9a993f1de726065f915919c5df84e432dcd9ad01e366bf0760c6fe","source_hash":"c14d2f7b1d8f5b92110a5fe54adc32082fa6600e7a22da7dfa2e5914cb6ad1e4","text":"第三条（关于入学资格的过渡措施） 2020学年通过入学选拔程序录取学士学位课程的学生，其入学资格按照以前的规定执行，不受第十七条第一款修改规定的约束。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00117","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY","start":11800,"end":11836,"target_id":"4f2952834d436583159b410ff68e57611dc4d0e5bcd6d095c7fbacece4a2884c","source_hash":"0419ec54cf64310b75eb8e6567846bb1846fa73cdb32487aaf12fda72423a766","text":"附录（警官任命法令）<第31351号，2020年12月31日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00118","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002202-266955-ko","scope":"BODY",